<title>INDIA: Castrol 97 first half sales up.</title>
<headline>Castrol 97 first half sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian lubricant maker Castrol India Ltd. said on Tuesday its net sales in the first half of 1997 had risen to 4.89 billion rupees from 4.23 billion in the corresponding period the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
